M 0.9.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"Groovounet","id":367227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzIyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/367227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet","html_url":"https://github.com/Groovounet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":72,"state":"open","created_at":"2012-09-12T10:39:21Z","updated_at":"2020-01-05T13:48:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2015-12-16T16:28:29Z","updated_at":"2016-03-05T22:32:15Z","closed_at":"2016-03-05T22:32:15Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Versions: 0.9.7.1 (bitfield.inl),  0.9.5.4 (bit.inl)\nCompiler: gcc 4.1 (fails both versions), gcc 4.8.3 (succeed both versions)\n\nTried to compile tests on x86, got this\n\n`glm/./gtx/bit.inl:551: error: integer constant is too large for 'long' type`\n\nConstants like 0xFFFF00000000FFFF is 64 bits long, which is allowed in C++11 only. \nRelatively new GCC just gives a warning, but old versions of GCC can't compile it, showing an error.\n\nMaybe adding ULL to the constants can help (0xFFFF00000000FFFFULL). Didn't test, though.\n","closed_by":{"login":"Groovounet","id":367227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzIyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/367227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet","html_url":"https://github.com/Groovounet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/463/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/463/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}